  "description": "In the near future, a small number of Alphas known as the Awakened are born with extraordinary powers. Diego should have been one of the strongest, but every time he uses his ability, his body betrays him with violent seizures. When he’s introduced to Shane, a quiet scientist who offers to create a stabilizer, Diego begins to feel an inexplicable pull toward him. As buried memories resurface, Diego starts to wonder if their meeting was fate, or the beginning of something that transcends time itself.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
